<p>You equip your mecharachnid with a stormcoil generator, a mechanical device that projects a powerful electrical field. On taking a hit greater than 15% of its maximum life, the excess damage will be reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6%, 29%, 42%, 51%, 58%</acronym> and converted into energy, giving your mecharachnid <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">7%, 15%, 20%, 23%, 26%</acronym> increased global speed for 2 turns.</p>